    "shortDescription": "Double Kayak hire - up to 2 hours",
    "description": "<p><b><u>PRE-BOOKING ESSENTIAL</u></b></p><p><b><u><br></u></b></p><p><u><b>Important - Pre-Check In procedure</b></u></p><h5>Please note in the interest of safety it is vitally important that all persons who will be onboard&nbsp; our kayaks complete a&nbsp;</h5><h5>Pre-Check In/waiver as soon as possible after making a booking request.&nbsp;</h5><h5><br></h5><h5>Accurate weights and information must be &nbsp;provided.&nbsp; This is for insurance, water safety and to help us plan for your day.</h5><h5><br></h5><h5>A Check In Form MUST be completed for ALL child passengers. Failure to complete a waiver before your arrival may result in a&nbsp; delay in commencing your activity.</h5><br><p><b>Please follow the link to print, complete and bring along yours -</b></p><h3><a href=\"https://www.barossaoutdoors.com.au/\">CHECK IN FORM</a><a href=\"https://www.barossaoutdoors.com.au/\"><br></a>&nbsp;</h3><br><p><b><u>Kayak and equipment hire - up to 2 hours&nbsp;</u></b></p><p><b>Single kayak</b>&nbsp;- suitable for 1 x adult/youth (Max. weight 120kgs)</p><p><b>Double kayak</b>&nbsp;- suitable for up to 2 x adults and 1 child (Max. weight 220kgs)</p><p>Package includes hire of&nbsp;kayaks, life vests (up to 3 per double kayak), paddles and use of dry bags. Extra lifejackets can be hired upon request.</p><p>&nbsp;<br></p><h4>\"Safety First!\"</h4><p>At Barossa Outdoors we want you to feel confident and most importantly safe on the water, even if you have never kayaked before. So if you are a complete novice don't worry. We provide all the equipment and local knowledge you will need to get started - making your hire a relaxing and enjoyable experience on the tranquil reservoir waters. We do ask that you comply with the following conditions regarding&nbsp;Weight Capacities, Lifejackets and the, Pre-Check In form to help us ensure your safety and enjoyment on the reservoir waters.</p>In the interest of safety, these maximum weight capacities MUST be adhered to. We reserves the right to alter the kayak manifest regarding passenger weights to ensure maximum stability on the water.<p><br></p><p><u><b>PFDs and Life Vests</b></u></p><ul><li><p>We only supply P.F.Ds. (Personal Flotation Devices/Buoyancy Aids) for adults over 40kg and for children over 25kgs. PFDs are only suitable to persons who can swim in the case of an emergency.</p></li><li><p>Our PFDs may not be suitable for some persons with physical disabilities.</p></li><li><p>We do not stock limited numbers of life-vests or life jackets for non-swimmers. Please advise if you require a lifevest for a non-swimmer</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><b><u>Gift eCards Available</u></b></p><p>Select this option at Checkout. Choose a date. Gift eCards valid for 12 months from the date chosen.</p><p><br></p><p><b><u>Didn't receive your Booking Confirmation?</u></b></p><p>Please check your email Junk and Spam Folders.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><b><u>Find Us</u></b></p><p>Location:</p><p><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/RbwuWCHydj9wc3SB9\">Warren Reservoir Reserve</a></p><p>Car Park 1</p><p>Warren Road<br></p><p>Mount Crawford</p><p>South Australia</p><p>SA5351&nbsp;</p><p>​</p><p><b><u>Contact Us</u></b></p><p>Email:</p><p><a href=\"mailto:barossakayakhire@gmail.com?subject=Kayak%20Hire\">barossaoutdoors@gmail.com</a></p><p>Phone:</p><p>General Enquiries &amp; Group Bookings&nbsp;</p><p>+61 (0) 499 500 604&nbsp;or</p><p>+61 (0) 423 386 854</p><p>​</p><p></p><p></p>",
